This page is a placeholder. Full REST API content is coming soon.
@end

You can expose RESTful APIs from your Wails v3 application using standard Go `net/http` handlers or a framework such as [Gin](/guides/gin-routing/). Because Wails serves your frontend through an asset handler, any HTTP handler can be mounted and reached from your UI or other clients.
